direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"The self-report Panic Disorder Severity Scale (PDSS) was administered on 21 April 2026. The","bbox":[91.0394,440.77353,548.30939,451.77353],"origin":[91.0394,449.27301],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"respondent obtained a total score of 18 out of a possible 28, with an average score of 2.57.","bbox":[91.0394,452.87354,533.74548,463.87354],"origin":[91.0394,461.37302],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Overall, the respondent's average item rating fell in the severe range, indicating frequent and","bbox":[91.0394,477.07355,541.9184,488.07355],"origin":[91.0394,485.57303],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"highly distressing panic episodes. These are with pronounced anticipatory anxiety and extensive","bbox":[91.0394,489.17355,559.36444,500.17355],"origin":[91.0394,497.67303],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"avoidance of feared situations or physical sensations during the past week. Panic-related","bbox":[91.0394,501.27356,523.91138,512.27356],"origin":[91.0394,509.77304],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"difficulties are likely affecting multiple areas of the respondent's life.","bbox":[91.0394,513.3736,418.3884,524.3736],"origin":[91.0394,521.87305],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Of the seven PDSS items, 3 items were rated at the extreme level:","bbox":[91.0394,537.57361,414.45041,548.57361],"origin":[91.0394,546.07306],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"- 1. ","bbox":[91.0394,549.82751,109.99239,560.82751],"origin":[91.0394,558.32697],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Panic Frequency","bbox":[109.9921,549.83636,198.02505,560.83636],"origin":[109.9921,558.32697],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"(extreme)","bbox":[201.08311,549.82751,248.14108,560.82751],"origin":[201.08311,558.32697],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":". The respondent reported they had full panic attacks occurring","bbox":[248.14131,549.82751,553.23755,560.82751],"origin":[248.14131,558.32697],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"more than once a day, more days than not.","bbox":[91.03931,561.92755,300.76529,572.92755],"origin":[91.03931,570.427],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"- 2. ","bbox":[91.03931,574.18146,109.9923,585.18146],"origin":[91.03931,582.68091],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Distress During Panic","bbox":[109.992,574.19031,224.30397,585.19031],"origin":[109.992,582.68091],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"(extreme)","bbox":[227.3622,574.18146,274.42017,585.18146],"origin":[227.3622,582.68091],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":". The respondent reported that they experienced extreme","bbox":[274.41998,574.18146,552.62115,585.18146],"origin":[274.41998,582.68091],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"distress during all panic attacks.","bbox":[91.03899,586.28143,246.93095,597.28143],"origin":[91.03899,594.78088],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"- 4. ","bbox":[91.03899,598.53534,109.99198,609.53534],"origin":[91.03899,607.03479],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Agoraphobic Fear and Avoidance","bbox":[109.99168,598.54419,285.41962,609.54419],"origin":[109.99168,607.03479],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"(extreme)","bbox":[288.47787,598.53534,335.53586,609.53534],"origin":[288.47787,607.03479],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":". The respondent reported they experienced","bbox":[335.53568,598.53534,549.54089,609.53534],"origin":[335.53568,607.03479],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"pervasive, disabling fear and avoidance of situations, with extensive lifestyle modification such","bbox":[91.03868,610.63531,548.9577,621.63531],"origin":[91.03868,619.13477],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"that important tasks were not performed.","bbox":[91.03868,622.73535,288.51062,633.73535],"origin":[91.03868,631.2348],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Note: Because the average score summarises across all seven items, extreme responses in","bbox":[91.03868,646.93536,539.14563,657.93536],"origin":[91.03868,655.43481],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"some domains can be masked by low scores in others. Clinicians should review individual item","bbox":[91.03868,659.03534,551.35565,670.03534],"origin":[91.03868,667.53479],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"scores alongside the average.","bbox":[91.03868,671.13538,237.77864,682.13538],"origin":[91.03868,679.63483],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Page 1 of 4","bbox":[510.23566,809.927,561.38574,819.927],"origin":[510.23566,817.65381],"font":"Helvetica","size":10.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]}],"tables":[],"chartObservations":[{"id":"chart_1","title":null,"type":"line","bboxPt":[69.26,334.772,520.261,393.213],"widthPt":451.0,"heightPt":58.441,"axisColour":"#333333","xAxis":{"status":"linear_ticks_observed","ticks":[{"value":0.0,"positionPt":69.26060000000001,"text":"0","