 couldn't do because of these problems","bbox":[51.18907,357.25629,483.19351,365.75629],"origin":[51.18907,363.82407],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"4    Extreme, incapacitating impairment, such that there was hardly anything social I could do","bbox":[51.1891,371.28711,399.84238,379.78711],"origin":[51.1891,377.85489],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Powered by TCPDF (www.tcpdf.org)","bbox":[3.0,839.89117,19.17,840.89117],"origin":[3.0,840.66388],"font":"Helvetica","size":1.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Page 4 of 4","bbox":[510.23599,809.92615,561.38611,819.92615],"origin":[510.23599,817.65295],"font":"Helvetica","size":10.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]}],"tables":[],"chartObservations":[]}],"rasterRegions":[],"rasterTranscriptions":[],"removedFalseChartDetections":[]}
